+[Warning: 21:22:22] Ini: Unknown entry explosion_impulse at section AsteroidMine: EXE\..\data/solar\Asteroidarch.ini, line 479
+[Warning: 21:22:22] Ini: Unknown entry explosion_impulse at section AsteroidMine: EXE\..\data/solar\Asteroidarch.ini, line 490
+[Warning: 21:22:22] Ini: Unknown entry MinSpecLOD at section Simple: EXE\..\data/ships\Shiparch.ini, line 6
+[Info: 21:22:24] Game: Finished loading game data
+[Info: 21:22:38] UI: Interface loaded
+[Info: 21:22:44] Game: Entering system FP7_system
+[Warning: 21:22:47] Client: Simulation overload: dropped 210 stale client simulation ticks to keep the game responsive.
